{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id357428194"}, "name":{"label":"Avenexist"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-05-30T06:00:13-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"22.5"}, "id":{"label":"8723166555"}, "title":{"label":"A must for persons with Add/adhd"}, "content":{"label":"I have been struggling to find a reminder app that actually works to remind me since I have add. I am beyond excited to finally have found this Due app. \n\nAll the other reminder apps seem to have maybe 1 feature of due, but none have all the key features in one like due does. \n\nBeing able to force reminders to REMIND ME over and over is so critical for add. When I am hyper focused I may not even notice a reminder go off, and without the immediate repeating reminders I will never disengage enough to get anything done with the reminder. \n\nNow I can get alerts 4+ times realize I’m not going to do it right now, and then immediately reschedule the reminder for 1 hour or a day or whatever I want with 1 tap. \n\nAnd if you guys are using due, definitely use the widget! The bigger widget has short links to add a reminder and get to timers which is so convenient!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id33889342"}, "name":{"label":"vandie"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-05-29T09:59:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"22.5"}, "id":{"label":"8720639412"}, "title":{"label":"I LOVE this app!"}, "content":{"label":"I have purchased and used so many reminder/calendar/scheduling apps, but none for very long.  They weren’t nearly as intuitive to use or as easy to make changes or set reminders.  I would use a calendar app (or 2), with separate to do apps and reminder apps.  I could never seem to get what I needed and wanted from one app.  I couldn’t imagine not having a calendar app but didn’t want reminders cluttering it up. This app truly does it all, intuitively, quickly and efficiently.  And it only took me 74 years to find!  Due just works!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
