{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id17348939"}, "name":{"label":"swmlvh"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-02-17T17:30:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"22.2"}, "id":{"label":"8367416785"}, "title":{"label":"Great app!"}, "content":{"label":"The best reminder app available. I’m really enjoying this app, it’s beautifully designed, easy to use, and so convenient to have. The snooze function is what I really appreciate. I’m not sure if it’s a glitch but sometimes reminders don’t turn on if I’m streaming video or music, after I close out on whatever I’m doing, I get a bunch of notifications all at one time. Hopefully that can be fixed. I’ve been using the Alarmed app by Yoctoville, and I’ve been looking for an alternative- this app fits the bill and I’m so glad I found it. The only thing I wish it had is a greater selection of sounds to choose from since I like to associate different reminders with different sounds (saves time not having to look at my phone every time I have a reminder). Please consider including such sounds as musical instruments, animals, and human voices (like the Alarmed app), I would definitely pay extra for additional sounds. Also, it would be great if you could pause a reminder. Thank you and I look forward to future updates. Keep up the great work!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id24592909"}, "name":{"label":"LDchristopher"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-02-17T03:37:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"22.2"}, "id":{"label":"8365236678"}, "title":{"label":"Perfect for ADHD"}, "content":{"label":"I was recently diagnosed with ADHD. I had always heard about this app but with my diagnosis decided to try it. It’s a game changer! Exactly the constant nag I need to remember things. I’m so forgetful but Due helps to eliminate that. If I push something into the future I have to make a constant choice, which is a very healthy way of deciding what to do at a given moment. \n\nThis does not take the place of my regular task manager. Instead, I use it for the things that I MUST remember. \n\nI can’t say thank you to Due enough! If you have ADHD or are forgetful, this app is for you!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
