{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id318889927"}, "name":{"label":"cyJacob42"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-02-06T18:45:13-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"22.0"}, "id":{"label":"8327594116"}, "title":{"label":"I love this app… when it works"}, "content":{"label":"I love the constant reminders. I need it to keep me remembering to do this. But, it doesn’t go off half the time! I have one reminder set daily and one that was set once but was supposed to repeat every minute neither went off. I guess it doesn’t work if the app has been closed? I tried opening it and it didn’t even work today either. I can’t be expected to remember to not close it out when I close all my apps… I missed a very important event because of this. I can not remember anything, so I need an app that works. I was hoping Due would be different. But it seems that it doesn’t work consistently… I really wish there was a way to fix this. Any help?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
